From e6e6bc31d9ba21b215f4cc9cecf803615c6ef245 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:13:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Labels for agents that cannot message the merge manager

Owner, 2026-11-13 (about 20:58Z): "need a way to mark this for agents not
able to communicate... label PR?" and "update process and tools".
ready-to-merge (green) and needs-repin (green except for a re-pin) on the
agent's own PR; a label is a request and only the merge manager acts on it.
merge-manager-watcher, merge-queue, the merge-manager actor and
merge-manager-watch.bpmn's wake step; checklist and .pot regenerated. The
tools follow-ups are listed in "What this does not do yet".

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VQDpPc2tT1vUufdyDbQTBz
